    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n22 hours ago\nSiri AI Updates Are Here and Apple Stock Is Falling\nSiri is becoming a more capable AI assistant, and a key issue that Wall Street has been waiting to see.\nApple showed off an updated Siri that can answer specific questions better than before while also taking actions on behalf of the user. In a demo at WWDC, an executive asked Siri to take certain actions, like finding specific photos and adding them to an album, setting calendar reminders, and more.\nSiri's voice also got an update. The chatbot sounds more human and less robotic than before. Users can adjust Siri's sound to fit their personal preferences.",
